### 6. Accessibility Finalization

Ensure implementation meets accessibility standards:

```typescript
// Run accessibility audit
run_terminal_cmd("cd front-end && npm run test:a11y", false, false)

// Fix accessibility issues
edit_file("front-end/src/components/FeatureComponent.tsx",
          "Fix accessibility issues",
          "// ... existing code ...
// Add proper aria attributes
return (
  <div
    role=\"region\"
    aria-labelledby=\"feature-title\"
  >
    <h2 id=\"feature-title\">Feature Title</h2>
    {/* Component content */}
  </div>
);
// ... existing code ...")

// Re-run accessibility audit to verify fixes
run_terminal_cmd("cd front-end && npm run test:a11y", false, false)
```

### 7. Final Implementation Verification

Conduct final verification of the entire implementation:

```typescript
// Run comprehensive verification
run_terminal_cmd("cd front-end && npm run verify", false, false)

// Check for final issues
grep_search("TODO|FIXME|@ts-ignore", false, "front-end/src/**/*.tsx")
grep_search("TODO|FIXME|@ts-ignore", false, "front-end/src/**/*.ts")

// Run lighthouse audit
run_terminal_cmd("cd front-end && npm run lighthouse", false, false)

// Verify visual consistency
run_terminal_cmd("cd front-end && npm run test:visual", false, false)
```

